    <!-- Help / Handbook -->
    <string name="help_title">MINE SAFETY PROTOCOLS</string>
    <string name="help_content">1. Always scan the surrounding rock roof and support sets before advancing.\n2. In electrical fires, locate Class C / dry chemical extinguishers; never use water on energized equipment.\n3. Aim nozzle at the base of flames using sweeping motions.\n4. When chemical or toxic gases breach, retreat upwind or maintain minimum 2-meter safety perimeter and engage emergency shutoff stations immediately.</string>
    
